<title>USA: Class action suit filed against StorMedia.</title>
<headline>Class action suit filed against StorMedia.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders in StorMedia Inc filed a class action suit against the company, alleging it artificially inflated the price of its shares, lawyers for the plaintiffs said Friday.  </p>
<p>The suit was filed on behalf of buyers of StorkMedia's common stock during the period November 27 1995 to August 9 1996.</p>
<p>The complaint alleges StorMedia and some of its officers and directors inflated the share price by misrepresenting demand for the company's products, according to a statement released by the plaintiffs' lawyers.  </p>
<p>StorMedia officials were not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
